Add VTK::mpi to the bundled h5hut module's dependencies.

ThirdParty/h5hut/vtk.module declares only DEPENDS VTK::hdf5. In an
MPI-enabled VTK build the bundled hdf5 reports H5_HAVE_PARALLEL, so
h5t_octree.h takes its parallel branch and #include <vtk_mpi.h> - a
header provided by VTK::mpi (Utilities/MPI/). Without a dependency on
VTK::mpi that module's include directory is never propagated onto the
h5hut compile line, giving 'fatal error: vtk_mpi.h: No such file'.
Only surfaces once IOH5part (which pulls in VTK::h5hut) is enabled in
an MPI build.

--- a/ThirdParty/h5hut/vtk.module
+++ b/ThirdParty/h5hut/vtk.module
@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@ SPDX_COPYRIGHT_TEXT
   Copyright (c) Ken Martin, Will Schroeder, Bill Lorensen
 DEPENDS
   VTK::hdf5
+  VTK::mpi
 TEST_DEPENDS
   VTK::TestingCore
 THIRD_PARTY
